<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0544_T20R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\rMy husband ain’t slept\nin like a week. I’m worried.\rWhen he deep in his “research,”\nhe forget to eat. And blink.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0544_T20R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\rMy husband ain’t slept\nin like a week. I’m worried.\rWhen he deep in his “research,”\nhe forget to eat. And blink.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0544_T20R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I grow up, I’ma help\nmy dad! He say he got a lab!\rI’ma be a GREAT\nPokémon Professor! Up all night!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0544_T20R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Pokémon. Where they come from?\nWhere they goin’?\rWhy ain’t nobody ever seen a\nPokémon get born?\rI gotta know! I’ma give my whole\rlife to this. And my teeth.”\r...\rIt’s part of Professor Elm’s\nresearch notes. It’s sticky.</language>
	</row>
</body>
